{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20134","headline":"送淡公 七 · 孟郊","name":"送淡公 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊洛气味薄，江湖文章多。\n坐缘江湖岸，意识鲜明波。\n铜斗短蓑行，新章其奈何。\n兹焉激切句，非是等闲歌。\n制之附驿回，勿使余风讹。\n都城第一寺，昭成屹嵯峨。\n爲师书广壁，仰咏时经过。\n徘徊相思心，老泪双滂沱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}